# ABP Autofac Integration

## Setup
ABP startup templates come with Autofac pre-configured.

### ASP.NET Core
```csharp
var builder = WebApplication.CreateBuilder(args);
builder.Host.UseAutofac();
```

### Console Application
```csharp
using var application = await AbpApplicationFactory.CreateAsync<MyModule>(options =>
{
    options.UseAutofac();
});
```

## Using Autofac API
Access `ContainerBuilder` in your module:

```csharp
public override void ConfigureServices(ServiceConfigurationContext context)
{
    var containerBuilder = context.Services.GetContainerBuilder();
    containerBuilder.RegisterType<MyService>().As<IMyService>();
}
```

## Why Autofac?
- Property injection support
- Dynamic proxying for interceptors
- Advanced registration features
